<p>
If you find yourself wanting to run code when a message gets sent, then definitely take a look at <code>message-sent-hook</code>.
You can add a buffer-local hook with the fourth argument to add-hook (ex: <code>(add-hook 'message-sent-hook (lambda () ...) nil t)</code>) so that you can take actions specific to that message.
</p>

